{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Lionel Template v1","description":"Grammar-first unified template draft for Lionel episodes derived from ten observation graphs.","graphId":"lionel-template-v1","version":"0.1.0","kind":"template","created":"2026-08-07T14:52:00.000Z","modified":"2026-08-07T14:52:00.000Z","author":"","tags":["template","lionel","episode-grammar","draft"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"lionel-template-v1-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Lionel Template v1","root":false,"position":{"x":-900,"y":-800},"width":440,"height":330,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1","name":"Lionel Template v1","version":"0.1.0","description":"Grammar-first unified template for Lionel episodes.","createdAt":"2026-08-07T09:52:00-05:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T09:52:00-05:00"},"intent":{"kind":"template","scope":"episode-analysis"},"declaration":{"kind":"graph","targetMode":"artifact","artifactKind":"template","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1","portNodeId":"lionel-template-v1-home","viewNodeId":"lionel-template-v1-home"}]},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","port","markdown"],"portContracts":["core"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":["github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/"]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}},"template":{"status":"draft","strategy":"grammar-first","classBacked":false}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-home","type":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1","root":false,"position":{"x":-390,"y":-800},"width":740,"height":320,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1","portId":"root","name":"Lionel Template v1"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Lionel Template v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🎙️ Lionel Template v1\n\n## One grammar, multiple episode shapes\n\nModel each episode as independent dimensions rather than one fixed layout.\n\n**Container + sequence controller + navigation mode + analytical structure + media/evidence + Lionel moves + production**\n\n`EPISODE → ISSUES + THREADS + SOURCES → LIONEL MOVES → SYNTHESIS`\n\n**The template provides vocabulary, not a cage.**"}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-config","type":"markdown","label":"Episode Configuration","root":false,"position":{"x":-920,"y":-300},"width":560,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"templateRole":"episode-configuration","containerMode":"recorded-lionel-owned","sequenceController":"thesis","navigationMode":"mostly-linear","markdown":"# ⚙️ Episode Configuration\n\n## Container\n`recorded-lionel-owned` · `live-lionel-owned` · `guest-appearance`\n\n## Sequence controller\n`thesis` · `evidence-audit` · `host-interaction` · `source-timeline` · `opponent-argument` · `media-queue` · `live-thematic-thread`\n\n## Navigation\n`mostly-linear` · `serial` · `source-bound` · `queue-driven` · `branch-and-return`\n\nThese dimensions are independent. A live episode does not have to be branch-and-return.\n\n## Starter presets\n**Thesis Episode** · **Live Episode** · **Media Episode** · **Guest Appearance**"}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-structure","type":"markdown","label":"Shared Structure","root":false,"position":{"x":-290,"y":-300},"width":600,"height":560,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"templateRole":"shared-structure","markdown":"# 🕸️ Shared Structure\n\n## Analytical topology\n**Issue Scope** · Claim · Standard · Evidence Item · Evidence Bundle · Hypothesis · Actor Field · Coalition · Research Funnel\n\nCore edges: `belongsToIssue`, `relevantTo`, `irrelevantTo`, `answers`, `doesNotAnswer`, `supports`, `contradicts`, `qualifies`.\n\n## Conversation topology\nTopic Thread · Thread Set · Branch · Return Point · Continuation State\n\n## Media topology\nMedia Source · Timed Media Segment · Transcript Segment · Embedded Source · Media Queue · Queue Item · Playback Transition\n\n**Conversation order and argument structure are separate graphs.** A fact can be interesting while irrelevant to a particular issue."}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-moves","type":"markdown","label":"Lionel Operations","root":false,"position":{"x":380,"y":-300},"width":590,"height":560,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"templateRole":"lionel-operations","markdown":"# 🧠 Lionel Operations\n\nUse a compact rhetorical palette:\n\n- Frames\n- States Thesis\n- Performs Issue Analysis\n- Comments on Media\n- Adds Context\n- Analogizes\n- Simulates Scenario\n- Models Another Perspective\n- Maps Actors\n- Synthesizes\n- Qualifies\n- Incorporates Audience\n\nPrefer role properties over tiny subclasses. `Simulates Scenario` can cover future projection, juror proof test, reconstructed response, strategic countermove, and parodic opponent modeling."}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-production","type":"markdown","label":"Audience and Production","root":false,"position":{"x":-650,"y":380},"width":590,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"templateRole":"audience-production","markdown":"# 💬 Audience + 🎬 Production\n\n## Audience Input roles\n`triggersBranch` · `answersPoll` · `proposesHypothesis` · `suppliesLead` · `corrects` · `buildsRapport`\n\nAudience suggestions are not automatically evidence.\n\n## Production events\nSponsor Break · thematic sponsor transition · Live Audience Presence · Programming Announcement · Deferred Topic · Continuation Promise · Ritual Outro · Community Close\n\nKeep production grammar distinct from argument ontology."}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-basis","type":"markdown","label":"Research Basis and Next Test","root":false,"position":{"x":20,"y":380},"width":760,"height":540,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"templateRole":"research-basis","sourceFolder":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/","classBacked":false,"markdown":"# 📚 Research Basis + Next Test\n\nDerived from `observation1.node` through `observation10.node`.\n\nStudies 1–6 discovered major composition and navigation structures. Studies 7–10 mostly validated, recombined, or compressed those structures instead of creating new episode families.\n\n## Draft-v1 decision\nThis pass deliberately uses primitive nodes with `data.templateRole` values. The next test is authoring, not more taxonomy.\n\nTake a fresh episode, copy this template, remove unused structures, duplicate only what is needed, and see where authoring becomes awkward. Then promote stable shared primitives and Lionel-specific operations into real class artifacts and promote stable relationships into semantic edge classes."}}],"edges":[{"id":"ltv1-e0","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-declaration","target":"lionel-template-v1-home","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"default surface","data":{"semanticRole":"default surface"}},{"id":"ltv1-e1","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-home","target":"lionel-template-v1-config","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"configure episode","data":{"semanticRole":"configure episode"}},{"id":"ltv1-e2","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-config","target":"lionel-template-v1-structure","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"select structures","data":{"semanticRole":"select structures"}},{"id":"ltv1-e3","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-structure","target":"lionel-template-v1-moves","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"performed through Lionel moves","data":{"semanticRole":"performed through Lionel moves"}},{"id":"ltv1-e4","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-moves","target":"lionel-template-v1-production","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"interacts with audience and production","data":{"semanticRole":"interacts with audience and production"}},{"id":"ltv1-e5","type":"reference","source":"lionel-template-v1-production","target":"lionel-template-v1-basis","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"feeds next authoring test","data":{"semanticRole":"feeds next authoring test"}}]}